      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really good start. The tone is exactly where we need it to be. \n\nOne thing though—I just ran it through the tool and the richness score came back a bit lower than I'd hoped for a flagship launch. To be honest, I'm not worried about the actual number as much as I'm worried about the \"prestige\" feel, but the marketing team is really pushing for a higher vocabulary metric to justify the campaign budget.\n\nCan you try a version that's a bit more... lush? I don't want it to be a mess, but try to lean into a more diverse and expansive range of adjectives to bump that score up a bit. Make it feel even more intense and layered.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
