      "content": "Okay, that's definitely more descriptive and I can see the score improving. \n\nBut honestly, looking at it now, it's still feeling a little \"safe\" for a luxury brand of our caliber. The marketing team is being really pedantic about that richness metric—they want to see it really push the boundaries of what the tool considers a high-vocabulary text. \n\nCould you take it one step further? Try to be even more evocative and maximalist with the language. I know I said don't make it nonsensical, but really push the density of those descriptions. If we can get that score significantly higher, it'll make my life so much easier with the budget approval. Just make it feel incredibly layered and rich.",
